JPC Portal v1.0.0
Release date: 2026-09-25 (final release)

Major features: employee & department management; annual plan -> target -> task
planning; report workflow with immutable versions and review/approval; OCR document
processing; AI report analysis (summary, validation, reference & similarity
indicators, findings, insights); performance records & KPIs; achievements (badges,
monthly achievements); data-quality scans; reporting & analytics; report exports
(CSV/XLSX/PDF); AI Chat with authorized tools; notifications with preferences,
delivery logs and demo samples; audit & activity logs; RBAC + Sanctum cookie auth;
private file storage; system health monitoring (application/database/queue/storage/
AI/OCR); administrative maintenance log with audit trail; backup verification guard;
user feedback and AI quality feedback loops (Phase 13).

Phase 14 (final release): full demo-scenario hardening — every portal surface
exercised by the four demo personas returns 200 in a live end-to-end run (93/93);
all surfaces covered by new PortalSurfaceRegressionTest (backend suite 406 passed /
1880 assertions; frontend 87 passed; oxlint 0 errors; production build PASS).

Known limitations: AI/OCR depend on provider availability when real providers are
enabled (offline fake engines are the default); similarity detection is an indicator
requiring human validation; frontend bundle is a single ~869 kB chunk; email
delivery depends on mail configuration.